    "detailed_description": "<strong>Death comes to us all . . . Sometimes he just wants to play cards!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HEAD TO HEAD WITH DEATH HIMSELF</strong></h2>Death likes nothing more than having a quick game of 21. Its his favourite hobby (apart from knitting!). However, he hates losing!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FAST PACED 21</strong></h2>Simply try and make 21 in any one of the four lanes available. Make 21 and Death gets annoyed! Get combinations of 21 in a row and max out the multiplier to extend your timer (life). Keep playing through the rounds and you'll be rewarded with special cards that may help or hinder your progress.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ACHIEVEMENTS GALORE!</strong></h2>Theres lots to aim for in the game along with all the achievements you'll want to unlock. Can you make a &quot;5 card trick&quot;? Will you quit on Death (do you dare?) or will you find out what Ghost Bustin' is?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SPECIAL CARDS</strong></h2>It would be a boring game of 21 if there weren't any Special Cards to play with and Death has supplied us with some of his best - &quot;The Blind Mans Curse&quot;, &quot;Heart Stopper&quot; &amp; &quot;Lane Bomber&quot; to name just a few. Some will help and some will hinder your progress. Death enjoys it when you receive a nasty card.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dead Simple 21 is simple to learn and easy to play. Its suitable for everyone and also has 3 different game modes to try your hand at.</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Death comes to us all . . . Sometimes he just wants to play cards!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HEAD TO HEAD WITH DEATH HIMSELF</strong></h2>Death likes nothing more than having a quick game of 21. Its his favourite hobby (apart from knitting!). However, he hates losing!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FAST PACED 21</strong></h2>Simply try and make 21 in any one of the four lanes available. Make 21 and Death gets annoyed! Get combinations of 21 in a row and max out the multiplier to extend your timer (life). Keep playing through the rounds and you'll be rewarded with special cards that may help or hinder your progress.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ACHIEVEMENTS GALORE!</strong></h2>Theres lots to aim for in the game along with all the achievements you'll want to unlock. Can you make a &quot;5 card trick&quot;? Will you quit on Death (do you dare?) or will you find out what Ghost Bustin' is?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SPECIAL CARDS</strong></h2>It would be a boring game of 21 if there weren't any Special Cards to play with and Death has supplied us with some of his best - &quot;The Blind Mans Curse&quot;, &quot;Heart Stopper&quot; &amp; &quot;Lane Bomber&quot; to name just a few. Some will help and some will hinder your progress. Death enjoys it when you receive a nasty card.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dead Simple 21 is simple to learn and easy to play. Its suitable for everyone and also has 3 different game modes to try your hand at.</h2>",
